contents.configuration.inlayHints.propertyDeclara:
Aktifkan/nonaktifkan inlay hints untuk implicit types on property declarations:
```typescript

class Foo {
	prop /* :number */ = Date.now();
}

```

contents.configuration.inlayHints.functionLikeRet:
Aktifkan/nonaktifkan inlay hints untuk implicit return types on function signatures:
```typescript

function foo() /* :number */ {
	return Date.now();
} 

```

contents.configuration.inlayHints.enumMemberValue:
Aktifkan/nonaktifkan inlay hints untuk member values in enum declarations:
```typescript

enum MyValue {
	A /* = 0 */;
	B /* = 1 */;
}

```
